{"step_index":1697,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-08T01:39:17Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-08T10:39:17+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-08T10:39:20+09:00\nThe search for \"\"Sperre\" \"051\" OR \"korea@sperre.com\"\" returned the following summary:\nThe information you are looking for relates to **Sperre Air Power AS** (often referred to as Sperre), a Norwegian manufacturer of air compressors[1][2].\n\n*   **Contact Information in South Korea:**\n    *   **Phone:** You can reach the Korea office at **+82 51 781 1110**[3][1]. (Note that \"051\" is the area code for Busan, South Korea)[3][4].\n    *   **Key Personnel:** The Country Manager for Sperre in Korea is Byungjin Yoon[1].\n    *   **Office Location:** The company is located in the Centum Sky Biz building in Haeundae-gu, Busan[3].\n\n*   **Email Clarification:**\n    There is no public record of an email address exactly formatted as \"korea@sperre.com.\" Sperre's global offices typically use regional identifiers (e.g., `asia@sperre.com`[5]) or the main after-sales address, `aftersales@sperre.com`[2]. You may wish to use the phone number provided above to verify the correct contact email for their Korean operations.\n\n*   **Note on Similar Names:**\n    Please be aware that **Sperry Marine** also operates in Busan (with a phone number starting with 051: +82 51 201 4063)[4]. Ensure you are contacting the correct entity, as they are separate companies.\n\nSources:\n[1] [sperre.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEaidyXsGGoweWs4OK_TxhXBa2XY_uK4i1tSk4oQQ5zJujdTUyLZUVIwGSR4fwLSJDbyJBpEZ2Q9fCjWnsU4Sf0H8vK2HpXBnj7lH3XyM_LMQ==)\n[2] [sperre.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGbiiu6wMFakh7XgvO_0waF2-WNDgtL9I3cE_6iglGad66DgNqjw8C6W5B2IRaS2wNxSuRG8Oh47GgHwsixDyAm3WO54zyWmfLHn6Cg3QA=)\n[3] [saramin.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFign5KyX1M1mH2xEpg1bfsf4qjU22Mc7dw